<title>GERMANY: SGL Carbon, Carbide offices searched.</title>
<headline>SGL Carbon, Carbide offices searched.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German cartel office said on Friday that it had arranged for the offices of SGL Carbon AG, Union Carbide and three other firms to be searched.</p>
<p>An official at the cartel office said the searches had taken place on Thursday.</p>
<p>SGL Carbon's shares had slumped 8.65 percent to 237.70 marks in early bourse trade on news that competition authorities in Europe and the United States were investigating the group on suspicion of price-fixing.</p>
